  "title": "Grilled Jerk Pork Tenderloin",
  "description": "Apple cider makes this jerk marinade unique, and a bit untraditional. For smoky flavor, add apple or hickory wood chips to the hot coals before grilling. Grilled pineapple makes a great side dish.",
